    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what's the point of learning from it? the lesson is that everything i do just falls apart in the end. i look at the last two decades and i just see a massive hole. i'm not looking for a lesson or a silver lining. i just feel like i've already paid the price and gotten nothing back. it feels like i'm just stuck in a game that's rigged and i'm just losing more every day.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
